Thus begins the tale for you:
Let the hen, a whole number, become two.
As long as the hen is less than the sum of ninety and ten, do:
Let the hen now be the product of two and the hen.
Proclaim the text of the hen.
So be it.
Proclaim "Rest, and then".
Proclaim the text of calling square with ten.
Speak "Amen".

To square, taking care as whole number, giving whole number:
Give back the product of the care and the care.
